  "changes": [
    "Peg damage rewards use a fixed six-coin budget for ordinary, clock and prism pegs and nine for armored pegs, independent of HP. Existing break rewards remain separate.",
    "The first Impact hit deals four times current Power, or six times against armor. Spent Impact balls deal ordinary Power damage; the Twin Power reset also resets Impact strength.",
    "Charged Impact balls display an aura and trail; the first hit displays a burst. Damage labels show actual HP removed. Earned-money totals grow, twist, glow gold and settle, with subdued stationary Reduced Motion feedback.",
    "Gelato entry costs 1000 Bakery coins after Bakery completion, paid once. Prior U-map trunks and optional branches, later Twin node, scenery, green affordable upgrades, ballistic guides and developer controls remain.",
    "Combat Trial revision1 clears old best times in both areas. Content fingerprints invalidate old unfinished checkpoints without resetting campaign wallets, upgrades, area ownership, Twin ownership or completed pending rewards."
  ],
  "update_compatibility": "Same Android preview package and development signing certificate as v0.6.10, with version code increased from20 to21. Install over the existing preview to retain package-private data. Old unfinished runs return Home because combat/reward content changed. Historical shop-only compatibility bridges do not apply to this rebalance. Old Trial times clear in both areas; new times persist. Checkpoint schema4 and Gelato launcher revision2 remain; combat Trial revision1 is new. Physical Android installation remains for user testing.",
  "monetization": "Local test service; no real ad or purchase accounts connected",
